  SuitSprite: {fileID: 0}
  CardStory: "The following day is better, in many ways.\r\n\r\nSpades2 feels less
    over the place, today. The distractions of the last few weeks seem dulled, somehow.
    He isn\u2019t quite sure why this happened. Maybe a good night of rest? Could
    be. He did sleep in, today. He didn\u2019t have time to check himself in the
    mirror.\r\n\r\nHe feels more aware today, even seems to do better in training.
    Recruits like him are full members of the order, unlike Trainees, but that doesn\u2019t
    mean they can slack off. Spades2 spikes haven\u2019t even undergone the first
    enjoining. He\u2019s getting left behind. I hate those spikes.\r\nEvery morning
    it is some chow, training, then some menial duty for them to carry out. It changes
    day to day, but always bores him. \r\n\r\nToday he is in recordkeeping. I pick
    up the pen and read the lines I have to transcribe. Ah, text. That is much better.
    The senior researchers don\u2019t have time for this, so it usually gets pushed
    down to grunts like Spades2."
